[en.FOCUS_C12_PROJECT_ROCKFORGED_WARRIORS]
Project Rockforged Warriors

[en.FOCUS_C12_PROJECT_ROCKFORGED_WARRIORS_desc]
Amid the flames of war, all the great powers are modernizing their firepower, while the Rock Farm is gradually falling behind. We need an entirely new decisive weapon to gain an overwhelming advantage in battle. Among the belongings Pinkie Pie left before she disappeared, I discovered one of her wild ideas—an idea that even Maud Pie had never truly considered. I will explore its potential with the Rock Farm's finest scientists and medical experts.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_PROJECT_ROCKFORGED_WARRIORS]
铸岩神兵计划

[zh.FOCUS_C12_PROJECT_ROCKFORGED_WARRIORS_desc]
各个大国都在战火中将自己的火力更新换代，采石农场已逐渐落后，我们需要一种全新的决战武器来帮助我们在与敌军正面交战时取得巨大优势。我在妹妹萍琪派失踪前留下的旧物中找到了她曾经的一个疯狂设想，一个连石灰派都从未真正考虑的设想……


